  "body": "## Overview (Phase F2: P03–P06)\nImplements Phase F2 core capabilities for TokTickIT Lab 3 (Work Packages P03, P04, P05, P06):\n\n- **P03 Data Migration:** Additive schema migration (`User` roles, passwords, `Session`, `PublicComment`, `InternalNote`, `seedKey`), idempotent seeding with unique `seedKey` isolation, and authentic Lab 2 migration proof chain.\n- **P04 Authentication Backend:** Argon2id password hashing, constant-time verification, session management via HttpOnly cookies, CSRF protection, and login rate limiting.\n- **P05 Authorization:** Session identity middleware replacing `X-Requester-Id` headers, role-based access control, ownership verification, and private notes isolation.\n- **P06 Authentication UI:** React `AuthContext`, Login screen, Change Password screen, role-based navigation and route guards, and session-backed ticket creation/viewing.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- **AC-14–AC-18, AC-31 (P03):** Schema expansion, data preservation, sequence continuity, credential provisioning, and idempotent seeding.\n- **AC-19–AC-27 (P04):** Argon2id hashing, login authentication, invalidation, forced password change, and session lifecycle.\n- **AC-28–AC-33 (P05):** Role authorization, ownership enforcement, private notes isolation, and non-leaking 403 responses.\n- **AC-34–AC-38 (P06):** Login UI, Change Password UI, role-appropriate navigation, route guards, and session ticket flow.\n\n## Verification Evidence\n- **Server Tests (Lab 3):** 66/66 passed on verified disposable test database (`toktickit_test`)\n  - `password.unit.test.ts`: 6/6 passed\n  - `authorization.api.test.ts`: 10/10 passed\n  - `auth.api.test.ts`: 14/14 passed\n  - `migration-regression.test.ts`: 12/12 passed (including isolated schema multi-step migration chain proof)\n  - `test-environment.test.ts`: 24/24 passed\n- **Client Tests:** 47/47 passed\n- **TypeScript Builds:** Server `tsc` (0 errors) & Client `tsc && vite build` (0 errors)\n- **Static Checks:** `git diff --check` passed with 0 warnings\n\nResolves #38",
